==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 1.33 seconds<sup>40f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Aku Doge]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Cerberus Kids]] spawn after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
If you can reach and destroy the enemy base fast enough, then you won't have to deal with the [[Aku Doge]] and [[Cerberus Kids]] that spawn. If they do spawn, use units that can deal high damage to their shields. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Mythical Titan Cat]] can make short work of the [[Le'boin|Le' Boin]] that spawns.

